### record manual payment

# /:invoiceId

POST {{baseUrl}}/invoice/record-payment/69ec65da7bc0f3d68ea3576e HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{estMir}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 20,
  "checkNumber": "CHK123456",
  "paymentDate": "2026-04-20T00:00:00Z",
  "paymentMethod": "CHECK"
}


